{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step</i> into a <strong>fantasy roguelike adventure</strong> where every run brings new challenges and cosmetic skins. Play from a third-person perspective and fight your way through diverse enemies, randomized items, and ever-changing encounters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While tha maps were not random generated, but they contain unique variations. \u2014and at the start of every run, a <strong>random map</strong> is chosen to keep the experience fresh. Prove your strength in the <strong>Boss Arena mode</strong>, where victory grants you \u201cmap key\u201d rewards, such as the ability to select your preferred map or reach a map that is not included in the random map pool.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemy Variety &amp; Specialization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Face off against a wide roster of enemies across multiple categories:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee</strong>, <strong>Ranged</strong>, <strong>Mage</strong>, <strong>Summoner</strong>, and of course, <strong>Bosses</strong>.\u00a0 <br>Each category features both weaker and stronger variants, with enemies specializing in unique combat roles. For example:\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Mage</strong> \u2013 heavy-hitting but slow.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frost Mage</strong> \u2013 balanced damage with a stunning freeze effect.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcane Mage</strong> \u2013 weaker attacks but faster casting speed.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies have <strong>passive</strong> abilities in addition to their active abilities., such as <strong>self-healing</strong>, extreme movement <strong>speed boosts</strong>, or <strong>devastating</strong> offensive skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Rewards</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can receive <strong>cosmetic skins</strong> as a reward for completing the specified number of maps.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>continuous updates</strong> with <strong>new maps</strong>, and <strong>features</strong> inspired by community feedback.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills, adapt to randomized challenges, and carve your path to mastery.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to die, again and again\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random enemy , item spawns\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal combat, unforgiving enemies\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New run always with different challenges\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate roguelike\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4070160?t=1774812474","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070160/4351127d0b6d4e459b0025f34009bf85b5d71d04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774812474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070160/d3b5f662e0ddc2beb8492d11e04dc6896ad2aa4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774812474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070160/d3b5f662e0ddc2beb8492d11e04dc6896ad2aa4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774812474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class